senses.gloss:
--(महीमयी) the divine boat given to Manu (Vaivasvata) by विष्णु in the shape of a fish to be tied to its horn;
1: M. 1. ३०-32; भा. I. 3. १५.
in the deluge it rescued the sun, moon, ब्रह्मा, नर्मदा, sage मार्कण्डेय, शिव, the Vedas, पुराणस् and other Vidyas from ruin;
2: M. 2. १०-15.
Druhyu to ply the ocean with.
3: Ib. ३३. २०.
